OL,5,G0930 Essential Classics
OL,6,     FIan Skelly plays the best in
OL,7,     Fclassical music, with discoveries
OL,8,     Fand surprises rubbing shoulders
OL,9,     Fwith familiar favourites.
OL,10,G1300 Classical Live
OL,11,     FAl Ryan celebrates summer
OL,12,     Fmusic-making in the UK and beyond,
OL,13,     Fincluding the BBC Philharmonic
OL,14,     FOrchestra and Philharmonia Chorus
OL,15,     Fperforming Beethoven's mighty
OL,16,     F'Choral' Symphony.
OL,17,G1600 Composer of the Week: Handel
OL,18,     F4/5. Donald Macleod delves into
OL,19,     FHandel's relationship with the
OL,20,     FBritish royal family, from
OL,21,     Fcoronations to court rivalries and
OL,22,     Fshifts in patronage.
